    thumb: '/project/ddschatbot/ddschatbot-thumb.webp',
    alt: 'DDS Chatbot — Thai disease-surveillance assistant',
    desc: 'Guardrailed Thai disease-surveillance assistant for DDC — tool-calling over a PII-free data mart. A 753-turn authorized red-team cut attack success from ~25% to ~1% in-session; 99.8% pass on a 3,819-run regression benchmark.',
